# 🏆 Bakome Bandia EA – Open Source Gold Scalper for MT5

**The most advanced open‑source Expert Advisor for XAUUSD – 12 strategies, ICT concepts, grid system, 4 broker sets. Formerly sold for $1999, now 100% free.**

[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow.svg)](LICENSE)
[![MQL5](https://img.shields.io/badge/MQL5-Expert%20Advisor-005F99)](https://www.mql5.com)

---

## 🔥 Features

- ✅ 12 built‑in strategies (trend, grid, momentum, etc.)
- ✅ ICT concepts: FVG, Order Blocks, Silver Bullet
- ✅ 4 broker sets (VT Markets, IC Markets, Roboforex, Fusion)
- ✅ ATR‑based risk management, trailing stop, break‑even
- ✅ Session filters: London (8‑9h) & New York (15‑16h)
- ✅ Multi‑timeframe analysis
- ✅ 100% open source – audit, modify, improve

